  "method": "2020 FUNCSTAT A town/township/charter township/plantation inventory union newly active 2024 units. Match reviewed own GEOID, own-item P774/P882, or exact normalized name/county/valid polygon point with no namesake place; ambiguous candidates held. 2024 Gazetteer internal point checked inside unmodified valid ACS2024 own MCD; exact 2020 PL060 POP100. Village/CDP/borough links use all PL750 blocks including water and empty blocks; entire statewide relation must have one MCD. No existing nonnull conflicting parent replaced. Build 6 removes the NAME suffix admission filter: every FUNCSTAT A GEOID in either Gazetteer has a disposition. Previously omitted identities are explicitly held for review. All related existing place classes receive dispositions, retaining split block parts.",
